It builds on BMFM-RNA / biomed-multi-omic (bmfm-targets), Copyright IBM Corporation,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:
  https://github.com/BiomedSciAI/biomed-multi-omic
  - the multi-field tokenizer and field configuration are used as a dependency
    (bmfm-targets 0.15.0, commit 7b9c139a9ff1c417ef9424acc865fc513775eec7);
  - the WCED pretraining objective in bmfm_methylation/llama/wced_llama.py adapts the
    Whole-cell Expression Decoder of BMFM-RNA to DNA methylation;
  - the beta-value encoder in bmfm_methylation/llama/scale_adapt.py follows the
    ScaleAdaptEncoder of bmfm-targets (bmfm_targets/models/predictive/layers.py).

scripts/methylgpt/finetuning/ contains files from MethylGPT, licensed under the Apache License,
